"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Almost 2,000 people are still missing, including hundreds of foreign nationals, as fears of a second flood linger. Some of the most dramatic footage from the deadly flash flooding is hidden from public view in China.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missing People After Flood\",            \"translated_version\": \"Casi 2,000 personas todav\u00eda est\u00e1n perdidas, incluyendo cientos de extranjeros, mientras hay miedo de otra inundaci\u00f3n. Algunos videos de la inundaci\u00f3n mortal est\u00e1n escondidos en China.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Personas Perdidas Despu\u00e9s de Inundaci\u00f3n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Turbulent international affairs have brought the vote forward, but the campaign has focused more on Iceland's important fishing industry.\",            \"english_title\": \"Iceland's Fishing Industry Focus\",            \"translated_version\": \"Asuntos internacionales dif\u00edciles adelantaron la votaci\u00f3n, pero la campa\u00f1a se ha enfocado m\u00e1s en la importante industria pesquera de Islandia.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Enfoque en Industria Pesquera de Islandia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Venezuelan interim president says the unusual agreement will help revive her country's economy.\",            \"english_title\": \"Venezuelan Economy Agreement\",            \"translated_version\": \"La presidenta interina de Venezuela dice que el acuerdo inusual ayudar\u00e1 a revivir la econom\u00eda de su pa\u00eds.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Acuerdo para Econom\u00eda Venezolana\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A woman who rented out homes to two al-Qaeda members speaks publicly for the first time - to the BBC.\",            \"english_title\": \"Woman Speaks About Al-Qaeda\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer que alquil\u00f3 casas a dos miembros de al-Qaeda habla p\u00fablicamente por primera vez - a la BBC.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Mujer Habla Sobre Al-Qaeda\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Mourners gather outside the palace as royals, politicians and citizens remember a beloved king, whose son has adopted the family motto 'all for Norway'.\",            \"english_title\": \"Remembering a Beloved King\",            \"translated_version\": \"Personas se re\u00fanen fuera del palacio mientras los reyes, pol\u00edticos y ciudadanos recuerdan a un rey querido, cuyo hijo ha adoptado el lema familiar 'todo por Noruega'.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Recordando a un Rey Querido\"        }    ]}"